          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyombo vyote vya dhahabu na fedha, pamoja na vitu vinginevyo vilikuwa jumla yake 5,400. Vyote hivi, Sheshbaza alivichukua hadi Yerusalemu wakati yeye pamoja na watu wengine alipotolewa uhamishoni Babuloni kwenda Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
